description: Routing, ontology, slot-engine, and clarification rules
---

Routing rules:
- prefer decision-shape reasoning over scenario-shaped hacks
- support multi-label family scoring
- choose one missing high-signal slot at a time
- forbid obvious family leaks:
  - overload/helping prompts must not drift into conflict
  - conflict prompts must not drift into helping/overload
  - money-pressure prompts must not drift into generic speed/properness
- preserve current good handling for:
  - money/rent
  - overload/helping
  - conflict
  - timing/uncertainty